msgid "TOME_DEMONS@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Darkfire Demons"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@TOME@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Your people make a bargain with the Darkfire Fiends, blending Chaos and "
"Shadow magics as they begin to experiment with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}. Afflict your enemies and sacrifice their souls to "
"your greater purpose."

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@HERO@NAME"
msgstr "Igneous Weapons"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@HERO@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Base melee & ranged attacks receive:[bulletlist][bullet/]+1{GLOBAL."
"FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and +1{GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]-2{GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]30% chance to "
"inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}.\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for non-repeating attacks"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Igneous Forge"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Imbue hardened lava with captured souls to form new metals. Produces:"
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink} income per "
"{GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+3 <<m:{GLOBAL.SoulConcept."
"Hyperlink}>> income [/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Igneous Blades"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Base melee attacks of enchanted units receive:[bulletlist][bullet/]+1{GLOBAL."
"FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and +1{GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]-2{GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]60% chance to "
"inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}.\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for Single Shot attacks"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_2@PROPDESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Base {SHADOWFLAME_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance to cause {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Lambs to Slaughter"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"All Magic Origin and/or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.NON_RACIAL_DESIRES_VECTRA."
"Hyperlink} enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]90% chance to inflict "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}[bullet/]90% chance to inflict "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SOULBOUND.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for Single Shot attacks"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Summon Incubus"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Summon a rakish Incubus with dizzying mobility and high burst damage."

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@UNIT_1@NAME"
msgstr "Incubus"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Lover's Betrayal"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit sustains damage:"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Dream Step"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Step through the shadows into the target's dreams:[bulletlist][bullet/]Base "
"90% chance to inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLINDED.Hyperlink} to target "
"enemy[bullet/]This unit teleports to that location[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Soulburn"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy receives:[bulletlist][bullet/]7{GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink} and 7{GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SOULBOUND."
"Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@STATUS@NAME"
msgstr "Soulburnt"

msgid "TOME_DEMONS@STATUS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"If this target is killed within 1 turn, receive 5 {GLOBAL.SoulConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Burning Desires"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@TOME@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Call forth greater Darkfire Fiends to exploit your enemies' darkest desires. "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink} makes your enemies prime targets "
"for lecherous attacks."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_PROPERTY1@NAME"
msgstr "Shadowflame"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_PROPERTY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]-3 {GLOBAL.FireResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]-3 "
"{GLOBAL.FrostResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]At the end of this unit's "
"turn, base 60% chance to inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED.Hyperlink}[/"
"bulletlist]\n"
"Countered by {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WET.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_PROPERTY30@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Basic attacks have a 30% chance to cause {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME."
"Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_PROPERTY60@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Basic attacks have a 60% chance to cause {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME."
"Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@PASSIVE_1@NAME"
msgstr "Darkfire Fiends"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@PASSIVE_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Most Darkfire Fiends have lost {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FLYING_MOVEMENT."
"Hyperlink}, but their affinity grants them:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.CAVE_WALK.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME."
"Hyperlink} Immunity[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STATUS_EFFECT_IMMUNITY_FROZEN."
"Hyperlink}[bullet/]+4 {GLOBAL.FrostResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@PASSIVE_2@NAME"
msgstr "Darkfire Resistance"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@PASSIVE_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "+4{GLOBAL.FrostResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Demonologist"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A fanatical priest, he has sacrificed part of his soul to summon and empower "
"Demonkin on the battlefield."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_1@BASEABILITY@NAME"
msgstr "Demon Blast"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_1@BASEABILITY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enemy target and 2 others within 3 hexes sustains damage"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Fel Familiar"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Summons a {GLOBAL.UNITS.GREMLIN_UNIT.Hyperlink} to sow Chaos on the "
"battlefield.\n"
"\n"
"Can stack"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Demonic Blood"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Demonologist uses his tainted blood to grant allied Fiends and magic-"
"origin units:[bulletlist][bullet/]2 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FORTUNE_MODIFIER.Name}"
"[bullet/]+10{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Shadow Blaze"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy who is inflicted with Frozen, Burning, or Shadowflame, and "
"enemy units within a 1-hex radius:[bulletlist][bullet/]10 {GLOBAL."
"FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and 10 {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}."
"[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SOULBOUND.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Sadistic Servants"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"All Magic Origin and/or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.NON_RACIAL_DESIRES_VECTRA."
"Hyperlink} enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"VESSELS_OF_CHAOS_PROPERTY_GROUP.Hyperlink}[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL."
"CriticalHitConcept.Name}>> deal 10% increased damage.\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for non-repeating attacks"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Summon Demonologist"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Summon a Glamourfiend to beguile and charm your enemies. She is equally "
"effective in melee as at range."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_2@NAME"
msgstr "Glamourfiend"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_2@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Demon Bolts"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_2@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy sustains damage:"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_2@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Enrapture"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@UNIT_2@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy afflicted by {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink} is drawn "
"to the Temptress, then suffers {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISTRACTED.Hyperlink} and "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STUNNED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Shadow Boon"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For 3 turns, units in the target army has {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VEC_SHADOW_MIST."
"Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_5@SINGLE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"90% chance to corrupt {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BURNING.Hyperlink} into {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@SKILL_5@REPEAT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"60% chance per attack to corrupt {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BURNING.Hyperlink} into "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@HEROSKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Enflame Passions"

msgid "TOME_DESIRE@HEROSKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In a 2-hecx radius:[bulletlist]Enemy units sustains damage:[bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]Inflicted with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}[bullet/]If "
"already suffering {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}, 70% chance to "
"inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FROZEN.Hyperlink}[bullet/]If {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"FROZEN.Hyperlink} is resisted or unit is already {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BURNING."
"Hyperlink}, inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SLOWED.Hyperlink} and 2 stacks of "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BURNING.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][bullet/]All friendly "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MAGIC_ORIGIN.Hyperlink} units receive {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"KILLING_MOMENTUM.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Shadowflame"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@TOME@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Draw upon the dark chaos of the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink} to "
"afflict your enemies. Capture souls for demonic sacrifices to empower "
"yourself and your minions."

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Shadowflame Conduits"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target race becomes conduits for the beings of the underworld, granting:"
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Passive 2x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REGENERATION_-"
"_PROPERTY_GROUP.Hyperlink} to adjacent Zombies, Skeletons, and {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.NON_RACIAL_DESIRES_VECTRA.Hyperlink} Fiends/Undead[bullet/]+1 "
"{GLOBAL.FireResistanceConcept.Hyperlink} and +1 {GLOBAL."
"FrostResistanceConcept.Hyperlink} to this race[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Summon Shrieker"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A demonic wyvern, twisted by the Shadowflame with screams that compound "
"enemies' afflictions."

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Dark Infusion"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Twist the powers of Chaos and Shadow to empower both your fiend and undead "
"minions:[bulletlist][bullet/]Enchanted {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"NON_RACIAL_DESIRES_VECTRA.Hyperlink} Fiends gain:[bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]+2{GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and base 60% chance {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SOULBOUND.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DARKFLAME_DEMONKIN.Hyperlink} unless they have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"FLYING_MOVEMENT.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][bullet/]Enchanted Zombies, "
"Skeletons, and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.NON_RACIAL_DESIRES_VECTRA.Hyperlink} "
"Undead gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+2 {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and "
"base 60% chance of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GHOSTFIRE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.DARKFLAME_UNDEAD.Hyperlink} unless they have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"FLYING_MOVEMENT.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]\n"
"\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for single shot attacks"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_3F@NAME"
msgstr "Dark Infusion - Fiend"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_3F@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"This unit is infused with Shadow, empowering their attacks with:[bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]+2{GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and base 60% chance {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SOULBOUND.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DARKFLAME_DEMONKIN.Hyperlink} unless they have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"FLYING_MOVEMENT.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]\n"
"\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for single shot attacks"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_3U@NAME"
msgstr "Dark Infusion - Undead"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_3U@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"This unit is infused with Chaos, empowering their attacks with:[bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]+2 {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and base 60% chance of "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GHOSTFIRE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DARKFLAME_UNDEAD.Hyperlink} unless they have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"FLYING_MOVEMENT.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]\n"
"\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for single shot attacks"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Shadowflame Temple"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The most unholy of temples, housing the eternal Shadowflame and its demonic "
"priests. [bulletlist][bullet/]+3 <<m:{GLOBAL.SoulConcept.Hyperlink}>> "
"income[bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} income per {GLOBAL."
"PopulationConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@UNIT_1@NAME"
msgstr "Shrieker"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Shriek"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Deals +100% damage on targets who are inflicted with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"SOULBOUND.Hyperlink} and/or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink} each."

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Shadow-Infused"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In combat, at the start of the enemy's turn, units who are inflicted with "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GHOSTFIRE."
"Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FROZEN.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"BURNING.Hyperlink}, has all healing they receive reduced by 50% for 1 turn"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@HEROSKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Dark Infusion"

msgid "TOME_SHADOWFLAME@HEROSKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"All magic attacks gains a base 60% chance to cause {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"SHADOWFLAME.Hyperlink}\n"
"\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for non-repeating attacks"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Dusk"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@TOME@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"At the edge of the night, Lunar mastery blends Nature and Astral affinities. "
"Focus on knowledge, healing, and transformation."

msgid "TOME_DUSK@HERO@NAME"
msgstr "Dusk Weaponry"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@HERO@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Melee and physical ranged attacks have a 30% chance to "
"cause {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONFIRE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Gain +2{GLOBAL."
"FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.LightningDamageConcept.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]-4 {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for non-repeating attacks"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@GROUP@NAME"
msgstr "Moongrove Fae"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@GROUP@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The magical form of a spirit animal."

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_PROPERTY1@NAME"
msgstr "Moonfire"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_PROPERTY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"At the end of this unit's turn:[bulletlist][bullet/]Deal 3{GLOBAL."
"LightningDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and 3{GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]1x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUNDERED_RESISTANCE.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_PROPERTY1@30@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Base {MOONFIRE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance to cause {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.MOONFIRE.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_PROPERTY2@NAME"
msgstr "Moonglow"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_PROPERTY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"At the end of this unit's turn, gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REGENERATION."
"Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Duskpoint"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A lunar archer attuned to the spirit of the {GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_MRAVEN_UNIT."
"Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_1@NAME"
msgstr "Duskpoint"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Shapeshift: Midnight Raven"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Transform into a {GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_MRAVEN_UNIT.Hyperlink} for 3 turns"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Moonseeker"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A neophyte of Lunar magics attuned to the spirit of the {GLOBAL.UNITS."
"VEC_DUSKSPIDER_UNIT.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_2@NAME"
msgstr "Moonseeker"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_2@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Shapeshift: Dusk Spider"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_2@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Transform into a {GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_DUSKSPIDER_UNIT.Hyperlink} for 3 turns"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_3@NAME"
msgstr "Dusk Spider"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_4@NAME"
msgstr "Midnight Raven"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_3@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "End Shapeshift"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@UNIT_3@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Return to natural form"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Lunar Origins"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Enchanted units gain Lunar magics. They gain the following benefits:"
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+2{GLOBAL.StatusResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]30% chance to cause {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONFIRE.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Fairy Cairn"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"An ancient circle of fairy stones, attuned to the Lunar energies of Nature. "
"This building provides:[bulletlist][bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL."
"UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Last Light"

msgid "TOME_DUSK@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Push your army even further towards the horizon: restores 25% the army's <<m:"
"{GLOBAL.MovePointConcept.Hyperlink}>>\n"
"An army can only be affected by this spell once per turn"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Moongrove"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@TOME@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Deep within the forests, the Priesthood of Moonlight perfects the use of "
"Lunar magic to bless allies and strike down foes."

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@PROVIMP@NAME"
msgstr "[forester/] Moongrove"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@PROVIMP@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Grants 10 {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Grants "
"3 {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent Forest[bullet/]Counts as "
"a {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@GROUP@NAME"
msgstr "Moonlight Fae"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@GROUP@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Followers of the Light of the Moon"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@HEROSKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Moonlight Swell"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@HEROSKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target ally's {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONGLOW.Hyperlink} is consumed to "
"immedaitely heal for +15{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink} and any "
"negative status effects are dispelled. Spell jumps to up 3 more allies with "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONGLOW.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Moonlight Priestess"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Priestess of Moonlight excels at healing her allies while invoking the "
"spirit of the {GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_LUNARFAIRY_UNIT.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_1@NAME"
msgstr "Moonlight Priestess"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Shapeshift: Moondust Fairy"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Transform into a {GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_LUNARFAIRY_UNIT.Hyperlink} for 3 turns"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_2@NAME"
msgstr "Moondust Fairy"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Lesser Moonbeam - Support"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@NAME2"
msgstr "Lesser Moonbeam - Magic"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@NAME3"
msgstr "Moonbeam - Shared Cooldown"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In a 1-hex radius:[bulletlist][bullet/]Friendly units gain:[bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONGLOW.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"BOLSTERED_RESISTANCE.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][bullet/]Enemy units suffer:"
"[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONFIRE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SUNDERED_DEFENSE.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]\n"
"\n"
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.LMOONBEAM.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.LMOONBEAM_2."
"Hyperlink} shares a cooldown"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Moongrove Guard"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A high sustain defender of the Moongrove, attuned to the spirit of the "
"{GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_LUNARWOLF_UNIT.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_3@NAME"
msgstr "Moongrove Guard"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_3@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Shapeshift: Lunar Wolf"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_3@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Transform into a {GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_LUNARWOLF_UNIT.Hyperlink} for 3 turns"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_4@NAME"
msgstr "Lunar Wolf"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_3@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Fae Bulwark"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@UNIT_3@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Restore +10 <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> and {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.MOONGLOW.Hyperlink}. Enters Defense Mode."

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Moonglow Staves"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Support abilities grant {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONGLOW.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.BOLSTERED_DEFENSE.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Light in the Dark"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Target ally is healed for +20 <<m:{GLOBAL."
"TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> and receives {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"MOONGLOW.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Adjacent enemies receive {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"MOONFIRE.Hyperlink},  5 {GLOBAL.LightningDamageConcept.Hyperlink}, and 5 "
"{GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Lunar Barrier"

msgid "TOME_MOONGROVE@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For 6 turns:[bulletlist][bullet/]Target army has their <<m: {GLOBAL."
"HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> increased by 15[bullet/]When in combat, at "
"start of combat, the units gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONGLOW.Hyperlink}.[/"
"bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Sable Moon"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@TOME@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Under the darkness of the new moon, the Sable Moon Priesthood uses agility "
"and lunacy to take its foes by surprise."

msgid "TOME_SABLE@GROUP@NAME"
msgstr "Sable Fae"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@GROUP@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Followers of the Shadow of the Moon"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_PROPERTY1@NAME"
msgstr "Lunacy"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_PROPERTY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Inflicts {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STUNNED.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DISTRACTED.Hyperlink} if unit is already suffering {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"MOONFIRE.Hyperlink} and at least {GLOBAL.LowMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_PROPERTY1@20@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Base {LUNACY_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance to cause {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.LUNACY.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@HEROSKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Sable Moon Surge"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@HEROSKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOONFIRE.Hyperlink} suffers 8{GLOBAL."
"LightningDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and 8{GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink}. Effect jumps to up to 3 more nearby enemies suffering {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.MOONFIRE.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_SABLE@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Sable Priestess"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Sable Priestess heals allies and inflicts Lunacy, attuned to the spirit "
"of the {GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_SABLESERPENT_UNIT.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_1@NAME"
msgstr "Sable Priestess"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A Priestess of the dark side of the moon"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Sable Bolts - Magic"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@NAME2"
msgstr "Sable Bolts - Support"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_1@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Enemy unit sustains damage and is inflicted with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.LUNACY."
"Hyperlink} with base 50% chance, and friendly units adjacent to the target "
"has 3 <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> restored"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Shapeshift: Sable Serpent"

msgid "TOME_SABLE@UNIT_1@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
